### Listar fincas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fincas

### Listar fincas (espera vacio)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fincas

### Obtener finca por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fincas/1

### Error 404 - finca no existente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fincas/999

### Crear finca
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fincas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "La Esperanza",
  "propietario": "Carlos",
  "vereda": "El Gualilo",
  "municipio": "Vélez",
  "hectareas": 12.5
}

### Crear finca solo campos obligatorios
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fincas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "El Porvenir",
  "propietario": "Ana",
  "municipio": "Puente Nacional",
  "hectareas": 8.0
}

### Error 400 - datos invalidos (nombre vacio, hectareas negativas)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fincas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "propietario": "",
  "municipio": "",
  "hectareas": -5.0
}

### Error 400 - hectareas en cero
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fincas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Finca Test",
  "propietario": "Luis",
  "municipio": "Bolívar",
  "hectareas": 0
}

### Eliminar finca
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/fincas/1

### Error 404 - eliminar finca no existente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/fincas/999
